 * obj.remove(key);
 */
```

**Flow for each operation:**

```
put(2, 5)  → idx = 2%1000 = 2 → scan bucket[2] → not found → add [2,5]
put(2, 9)  → idx = 2%1000 = 2 → scan bucket[2] → found p[0]==2 → update p[1]=9
get(2)     → idx = 2%1000 = 2 → scan bucket[2] → found p[0]==2 → return 9
remove(2)  → idx = 2%1000 = 2 → scan bucket[2] → found at i=0  → remove it
get(2)     → idx = 2%1000 = 2 → scan bucket[2] → not found     → return -1
```

